+// [Reforged 0043] Each reforge pays one Aether Heart. The 1.14.7 game server pays it itself only after reading the
+// weapon back (GET /progression/<user>/<track>, which has no route here) and only from the prestige track's
+// `prestige.free_rewards`, which the generated config does not carry (the export has no table for it). So after the
+// reset it stopped, and no reforge ever paid a Heart (VPS 2026-10-25: Spear reforges 2 and 3, -100 sparks each, no
